  "comments": "Concise guide to the Madhy\u0101ntavibh\u0101ga (ID:3748) with references to Sthiramati's \u1e6d\u012bk\u0101/bh\u0101\u1e63ya (ID: 6261) and Vasubandhu's t\u012bk\u0101 (ID: 5585). The author also compares both commentaries on specific points, but does not discuss other Tibetan interpretations.\r\nThis work probably corresponds to the \"don bdus\" listed by several Tibetan scholars (see <<Kano 2016 [BAQ9MH4T]>>: 202-203). A \"rnam bshad\" is also listed, which is not extant (ID: 6054).",
